(1,1,'2000-02-20','2026-02-21','ghsdfg','Approved','','2026-02-19 11:38:46',1,'2026-02-19 11:39:44'),
(2,1,'2026-02-20','2026-02-21','I would like to request permission to go on a tour from [start date] to [end date]. This tour is important to me as it will give me an opportunity to relax, explore new places, and spend quality time with my family/friends. I assure you that I will complete all my pending work before leaving and manage my responsibilities properly. Kindly grant me permission for the mentioned dates. I will be very grateful for your understanding and support.','Rejected','I understand your request for leave to go on a tour; however, I regret to inform you that I cannot grant permission at this time. The requested dates coincide with important academic activities and ongoing lessons that require your presence in class. Regular attendance is essential to ensure you do not miss important topics and assessments. Therefore, I must decline your leave application. I encourage you to plan your tour during scheduled holidays to avoid disruption to your studies.','2026-02-19 12:45:46',1,'2026-02-19 12:47:20');
